Entertainment.

16
01:33:54,782 --> 01:34:00,782
The Bridges of Madison County is set in 1965 and features Italian war bride Francesca Johnson
(Meryl Streep), who lives with her husband and two children on their Iowa farm.

17
01:39:46,956 --> 01:39:52,956
That year she meets National Geographic photojournalist Robert Kincaid (Clint Eastwood), who
comes to Madison County, Iowa to photograph its historic covered bridges.

18
01:45:39,130 --> 01:45:45,130
With Francesca's family away for a short trip, the couple
have an intense, four-day love affair.

19
01:51:31,304 --> 01:51:37,304
The film was released on 2 June 1995 and earned $182 million worldwide.

20
01:57:23,478 --> 01:57:29,478
It received generally positive reviews upon release, with high praise directed towards Streep's performance,
earning her a nomination for the Academy Award for Best Actress at the 68th Academy Awards.

21
